  "items": [
    {
      "source": "A <a href=\"../../../View.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.servlet\"><code>View</code></a> return type has a set purpose. Therefore this handler\nshould be configured ahead of handlers that support any return value type\nannotated with <code>@ModelAttribute</code> or <code>@ResponseBody</code> to ensure\nthey don't take over.",
      "translation": "`View` 返回类型具有特定的用途。因此，此处理器应配置在支持任何返回值类型并标注了 `@ModelAttribute` 或 `@ResponseBody` 的处理器之前，以确保它们不会接管。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "A <code>null</code> return value is left as-is leaving it to the configured\n<a href=\"../../../RequestToViewNameTranslator.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.servlet\"><code>RequestToViewNameTranslator</code></a> to select a view name by convention.",
      "translation": "`null` 返回值保持不变，交由配置的 <a href=\"../../../RequestToViewNameTranslator.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.servlet\"><code>RequestToViewNameTranslator</code></a> 按约定选择视图名称。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Handle the given return value by adding attributes to the model and\nsetting a view or setting the\n<a href=\"../../../../method/support/ModelAndViewContainer.html#setRequestHandled(boolean)\"><code>ModelAndViewContainer.setRequestHandled(boolean)</code></a> flag to <code>true</code>\nto indicate the response has been handled directly.",
      "translation": "处理给定的返回值，通过向模型添加属性并设置视图，或设置<a href=\"../../../../method/support/ModelAndViewContainer.html#setRequestHandled(boolean)\"><code>ModelAndViewContainer.setRequestHandled(boolean)</code></a>标志为<code>true</code>，以指示响应已被直接处理。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Whether the given <a href=\"../../../../../core/MethodParameter.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.core\">method return type</a> is\nsupported by this handler.",
      "translation": "给定<a href=\"../../../../../core/MethodParameter.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.core\">方法返回类型</a>是否由该处理器支持。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">Description copied from interface: <code><a href=\"../../../../method/support/HandlerMethodReturnValueHandler.html#supportsReturnType(org.springframework.core.MethodParameter)\">HandlerMethodReturnValueHandler</a></code></span>",
      "translation": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">描述从接口复制：<code><a href=\"../../../../method/support/HandlerMethodReturnValueHandler.html#supportsReturnType(org.springframework.core.MethodParameter)\">HandlerMethodReturnValueHandler</a></code></span>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">Description copied from interface: <code><a href=\"../../../../method/support/HandlerMethodReturnValueHandler.html#handleReturnValue(java.lang.Object,org.springframework.core.MethodParameter,org.springframework.web.method.support.ModelAndViewContainer,org.springframework.web.context.request.NativeWebRequest)\">HandlerMethodReturnValueHandler</a></code></span>",
      "translation": "<span class=\"description-from-type-label\">描述从接口复制：<code><a href=\"../../../../method/support/HandlerMethodReturnValueHandler.html#handleReturnValue(java.lang.Object,org.springframework.core.MethodParameter,org.springframework.web.method.support.ModelAndViewContainer,org.springframework.web.context.request.NativeWebRequest)\">HandlerMethodReturnValueHandler</a></code></span>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a href=\"../../../../method/support/HandlerMethodReturnValueHandler.html#supportsReturnType(org.springframework.core.MethodParameter)\">supportsReturnType</a></code> in interface <code><a href=\"../../../../method/support/HandlerMethodReturnValueHandler.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.method.support\">HandlerMethodReturnValueHandler</a></code>",
      "translation": "`HandlerMethodReturnValueHandler` 接口中的 <code><a href=\"../../../../method/support/HandlerMethodReturnValueHandler.html#supportsReturnType(org.springframework.core.MethodParameter)\">supportsReturnType</a></code>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a href=\"../../../../method/support/HandlerMethodReturnValueHandler.html#handleReturnValue(java.lang.Object,org.springframework.core.MethodParameter,org.springframework.web.method.support.ModelAndViewContainer,org.springframework.web.context.request.NativeWebRequest)\">handleReturnValue</a></code> in interface <code><a href=\"../../../../method/support/HandlerMethodReturnValueHandler.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.method.support\">HandlerMethodReturnValueHandler</a></code>",
      "translation": "`HandlerMethodReturnValueHandler` 接口中的 `handleReturnValue`",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>returnType</code> - the type of the return value. This type must have\npreviously been passed to <a href=\"../../../../method/support/HandlerMethodReturnValueHandler.html#supportsReturnType(org.springframework.core.MethodParameter)\"><code>HandlerMethodReturnValueHandler.supportsReturnType(MethodParameter)</code></a> which must\nhave returned <code>true</code>.",
      "translation": "<code>returnType</code> - 返回值的类型。此类型必须此前已传递给<a href=\"../../../../method/support/HandlerMethodReturnValueHandler.html#supportsReturnType(org.springframework.core.MethodParameter)\"><code>HandlerMethodReturnValueHandler.supportsReturnType(MethodParameter)</code></a>，且该调用必须返回<code>true</code>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>true</code> if this handler supports the supplied return type;\n<code>false</code> otherwise",
      "translation": "<code>true</code> 如果此处理器支持提供的返回类型；否则为 <code>false</code>。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Exception.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">Exception</a></code> - if the return value handling results in an error",
      "translation": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Exception.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">Exception</a></code> - 如果返回值处理导致错误",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>returnType</code> - the method return type to check",
      "translation": "<code>returnType</code> - 要检查的方法返回类型",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>returnValue</code> - the value returned from the handler method",
      "translation": "<code>returnValue</code> - 从处理程序方法返回的值",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>mavContainer</code> - the ModelAndViewContainer for the current request",
      "translation": "<code>mavContainer</code> - 当前请求的 ModelAndViewContainer",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
